@startuml
title Coupler: Message Chains -- AFTER (Refactored)

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #D4EDDA
skinparam ClassBorderColor #28A745
skinparam ClassFontSize 13
skinparam ClassAttributeFontSize 12

note "REFACTORED: Hide Delegate\nChain hidden via wrapper methods" as N1 #69DB7C

class InvoiceGenerator <<Clean Code>> {
  + getCustomerCity(order : Order) : String
  .. <color:#28A745>return order.getCustomerCityName()</color> ..
}

class Order <<Clean Code>> {
  - customer : Customer
  --
  + **getCustomerCityName() : String**
  .. <color:#28A745>return customer.getCityName()</color> ..
}

class Customer <<Clean Code>> {
  - address : Address
  --
  + **getCityName() : String**
  .. <color:#28A745>return address.getCityName()</color> ..
}

class Address <<Clean Code>> {
  - city : City
  --
  + **getCityName() : String**
  .. <color:#28A745>return city.getName()</color> ..
}

class City <<Clean Code>> {
  - name : String
  --
  + getName() : String
}

InvoiceGenerator -[#28A745]-> Order : <color:#28A745>single call
Order -[hidden]-> Customer
Customer -[hidden]-> Address
Address -[hidden]-> City

N1 .. Order

note bottom of InvoiceGenerator
  <color:#28A745><b>Benefits:</b></color>
  - Client only knows about Order
  - Internal structure changes do not affect client
  - Follows Law of Demeter
  - Each class delegates one step
end note

@enduml
